.Dd October 17, 2026
.Dt PATINA-MENU 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-menu
.Nd the Patina desktop's menu
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -at Ar x , Ns Ar y
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the menu a right click on the empty desktop opens.
.Xr patina-compositor 1
runs it, as its
.Ic desktop_menu ,
at the pointer.
.Pp
It offers the skins, Patina's built-ins and your own: choosing one sets
.Ic skin
in the bar's config, and the bar and wallpaper change at once, the other
pieces when they next open.
Below them are Wallpaper\&..., which opens
.Xr patina-settings 1
at its Wallpaper page; items to copy the built-in skins to the bar's skins
folder, to open that folder, and to open the bar's config file; and
Settings\&....
A click elsewhere, Escape, or losing the keyboard closes it.
.Pp
Settings is started by the compositor, so it's listed on its Processes
page; outside Patina's compositor the menu starts it itself.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -at Ar x , Ns Ar y
Where to open, in the screen's logical pixels; the top-left corner
without it.
.It Fl h , -help
Print a short usage message.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.config/patina-bar/config.toml
Where the skin is written.
.It Pa ~/.config/patina-bar/skins/
Skins of your own.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-bar 1 ,
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
